name: Te lucis ante terminum;
office-part: Hymnus;
mode: 7;
book: Completorium O.P. (Suarez, 1949), p. 15: In Festo Toto Duplici communi; melody GregoBase 9957 (Antiphonarium O.P. 1933, Gillet), stanzas 2-3 to the same melody;
